              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "jonlul"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a very good recipe. Very much like a guacamole on steriods. I used fresh garlic instead of powder and added chives instead of parsley. I think dried parsley has very little flavor, if I had fresh I would've used it.",
            "datePublished": "2011-08-28T22:22:30.283Z"
