              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BrittSimps"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I didn't follow the original recipe, I used it more as a guide.. I used a whole avocado, 1/2 lime, balsamic instead of white vinegar, mayo, fresh garlic, fresh parsley, I didn't have buttermilk so I used a spoon of sour cream &amp; a splash of cream. I also added cilantro.",
            "datePublished": "2015-12-04T16:01:31.490Z"
          },
          {
