              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Markeita Pruitt"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I and hubby loved this. Because I was using it on a southwestern salad, I opted for fresh organic cilantro instead of parsley, but other than that.... it was delicious! Hubby is picky and he was skeptical, but nodded in approval. Thanks for sharing!!",
            "datePublished": "2014-07-30T17:55:43.387Z"
