              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Christine Wulf"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I use this recipe all the time. I was trying to replicate the avocado ranch dressing from Casa Gallardo and this does it! I am much more heavy with the seasonings, esp garlic, but the base recipe is great.",
            "datePublished": "2023-11-14T22:01:08.966Z"
